<p>In the latest development, a 14-year-old eighth-grade student opened fire in two classrooms at a middle school in Onikişubat, Kahramanmaras Province, southern Turkey, on Wednesday, killing nine people and injuring 13 others before dying during the incident, authorities said.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/O6vQGsDq5AEnmVCpVtWIRVMmUJrAA-ikaD8iNt-HtQpGxlrGcgQA5SHo5V1RFvMEzlmFlaf6cC7q4LDWGD8F7mqKNBFtSZf5ab8RuTk-uvWh' alt='Police officers in uniform and plainclothes police secure the site after a deadly school shooting, in the southeastern province of Kahramanmaras, Turkiye on April 15, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Critical injuries: Six of the 13 wounded were in intensive care, and three of them were in critical condition, Interior Minister Mustafa Ciftci said.</li><li>Concealed weapons: Officials said the eighth-grader hid the firearms in a backpack before carrying out the attack.</li><li>Security response: Police tightened security around the school after the shooting as ambulances evacuated the injured and families rushed to the scene.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Interior Minister Mustafa Ciftci: He said the dead included eight students and one teacher. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991984/nine-killed-13-wounded-after-school-shooting-in-turkiyes-second-school-shooting-in-2-days'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Governor Mukerrem Unluer: He said the suspect was carrying five guns and seven magazines, and investigators suspected he had taken the weapons from his father. He added that it was still unclear whether the boy died by suicide or in the chaos of the attack. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991984/nine-killed-13-wounded-after-school-shooting-in-turkiyes-second-school-shooting-in-2-days'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Witness footage verified by AFP: Images described by Dawn showed students escaping by jumping from a first-floor window, while dozens of others ran across the courtyard after gunfire erupted. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991984/nine-killed-13-wounded-after-school-shooting-in-turkiyes-second-school-shooting-in-2-days'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/15/world/europe/turkey-school-shooting-kahramanmaras-province.html'>At Least 4 Dead in Second School Shooting in Turkey in 2 Days</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://japantoday.com/category/world/Student-kills-9-in-Turkey%27s-second-school-shooting-in-2-days'>Student kills 9 in Turkey&#x27;s second school shooting in 2 days</a> - japantoday.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/04/15/shooting-in-turkish-school-leaves-at-least-nine-dead-and-13-injured_6752464_4.html'>Shooting in Turkish school leaves at least nine dead and 13 injured</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.allsides.com/news/2026-04-15-0700/world-least-4-dead-second-school-shooting-turkey-two-days'>At Least 4 Dead in Second School Shooting in Turkey in Two Days</a> - allsides.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991984/nine-killed-13-wounded-after-school-shooting-in-turkiyes-second-school-shooting-in-2-days'>Nine killed, 13 wounded after school shooting in Turkiye’s second school shooting in 2 days</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/video/2026/04/15/panicked-scenes-after-school-shooting-in-turkey-leaves-at-least-nine-dead'>Panicked scenes after school shooting in Turkey leaves at least nine dead</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/turkey-school-shooting-kahramanmaras/'>Eighth grader kills 9, wounds 13 in Turkey school shooting</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/four-dead-after-turkiyes-second-school-shooting-in-two-days/article70865199.ece'>Student kills 9 in Turkiye’s second school shooting in 2 days</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cn088n9e6e9o'>Nine killed in second Turkish school shooting in two days</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href=